This is a collection of tools that I currently use.


# Random CLI Tools

## Embedded Work
*scope - serial inspector (better telnet)*
[scope](https://terminaltrove.com/scope/)

## Documentation
*mandible - breaks down --help docs for CLIs*
[mandible](https://terminaltrove.com/mandible/)

## Linux OS Management
*rwx - inspector for FS permissions*
[rwx](https://terminaltrove.com/rwx/)

## Repo management
*drydock - view state of many git repos*
[drydock](https://terminaltrove.com/drydock/)


## LLM Coding

crit.md - leave comments on local commits

## VCS

jj-vcs - this is my primary way of interacting with repositories

jjui - this is the TUI I use when I need to visualize the graph beyond a simple `jj log`

oyui - TUI merge editor

### Exploring

jj-vine
